capability font/draw  glyphs rasterised and text drawn into an image
  heroes  pending
  go      font.Drawer, font.Drawer.DrawString, DrawBytes, font.Face, font.Hinting, opentype.NewFace, opentype.Face, opentype.FaceOptions, basicfont.Face7x13, basicfont.Face, basicfont.Range, Face.Glyph, Face.GlyphBounds, Face.GlyphAdvance, Face.Metrics, Face.Close
